如补士4进5，则显得子力呆滞。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"0:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment28","raw_text":" 目前，黑车尚未出动，即跃左马谋求削弱红方攻势，恐难如愿。","text":" 目前，黑车尚未出动，即跃左马谋求削弱红方攻势，恐难如愿。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment30","raw_text":"黑如改走象3进5或象3进l固守稍好。","text":"黑如改走象3进5或象3进l固守稍好。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"0:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment32","raw_text":"此时形势，黑出子落后，红方攻势方兴未艾。黑在此形势下炮击中兵，有嫌轻率，造成关键性的失误，应走炮5平3，尚可抵挡一阵。以下实战，红方巧施妙手，借劲连续跃马，构成车双马炮四子合围之势。","text":"此时形势，黑出子落后，红方攻势方兴未艾。黑在此形势下炮击中兵，有嫌轻率，造成关键性的失误，应走炮5平3，尚可抵挡一阵。以下实战，红方巧施妙手，借劲连续跃马，构成车双马炮四子合围之势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment40:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment40","raw_text":" 黑如车2进2去炮，则马八进六，将5进1，马四进三，将5进1，马三进四，将5退1，红再车平右翼绝杀，妙胜。","text":" 黑如车2进2去炮，则马八进六，将5进1，马四进三，将5进1，马三进四，将5退1，红再车平右翼绝杀，妙胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":40,"anchor_node_id":"0:40","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment45:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment45","raw_text":"(得车，红胜)","text":"(得车，红胜)","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":45,"anchor_node_id":"0:45","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["007四川蒋全胜 先胜 浙江蔡伟林"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["C21 中炮过河车七路马对屏风马两头蛇"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":16,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source m